{"1":{"w":[{"c":"يُسَبِّحُ","d":"yusabbiḥu","e":"Glorifies"},{"c":"لِلَّهِ","d":"lillahi","e":"[to] Allah"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"whatever"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(is) in"},{"c":"السَّمَاوَاتِ","d":"l-samāwāti","e":"the heavens"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and whatever"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(is) in"},{"c":"الْأَرْضِ","d":"l-arḍi","e":"the earth"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"For Him"},{"c":"الْمُلْكُ","d":"l-mul'ku","e":"(is the) dominion"},{"c":"وَلَهُ","d":"walahu","e":"and for Him"},{"c":"الْحَمْدُ","d":"l-ḥamdu","e":"(is) the praise"},{"c":"وَهُوَ","d":"wahuwa","e":"And He"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"(is) on"},{"c":"كُلِّ","d":"kulli","e":"every"},{"c":"شَيْءٍ","d":"shayin","e":"thing"},{"c":"قَدِيرٌ","d":"qadīrun","e":"All-powerful"}],"a":{"g":"Whatever is in the heavens and whatever is on the earth is exalting Allah. To Him belongs dominion, and to Him belongs [all] praise, and He is over all things competent."}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"He"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"(is) the One Who"},{"c":"خَلَقَكُمْ","d":"khalaqakum","e":"created you"},{"c":"فَمِنْكُمْ","d":"faminkum","e":"and among you"},{"c":"كَافِرٌ","d":"kāfirun","e":"(is) a disbeliever"},{"c":"وَمِنْكُمْ","d":"waminkum","e":"and among you"},{"c":"مُؤْمِنٌ","d":"mu'minun","e":"(is) a believer"},{"c":"وَاللَّهُ","d":"wal-lahu","e":"And Allah"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"of what"},{"c":"تَعْمَلُونَ","d":"taʿmalūna","e":"you do"},{"c":"بَصِيرٌ","d":"baṣīrun","e":"(is) All-Seer"}],"a":{"g":"It is He who created you, and among you is the disbeliever, and among you is the believer. And Allah, of what you do, is Seeing."}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"خَلَقَ","d":"khalaqa","e":"He created"},{"c":"السَّمَاوَاتِ","d":"l-samāwāti","e":"the heavens"},{"c":"وَالْأَرْضَ","d":"wal-arḍa","e":"and the earth"},{"c":"بِالْحَقِّ","d":"bil-ḥaqi","e":"with truth"},{"c":"وَصَوَّرَكُمْ","d":"waṣawwarakum","e":"and He formed you"},{"c":"فَأَحْسَنَ","d":"fa-aḥsana","e":"and made good"},{"c":"صُوَرَكُمْ","d":"ṣuwarakum","e":"your forms"},{"c":"وَإِلَيْهِ","d":"wa-ilayhi","e":"and to Him"},{"c":"الْمَصِيرُ","d":"l-maṣīru","e":"(is) the final return"}],"a":{"g":"He created the heavens and earth in truth and formed you and perfected your forms; and to Him is the [final] destination."}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"يَعْلَمُ","d":"yaʿlamu","e":"He knows"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(is) in"},{"c":"السَّمَاوَاتِ","d":"l-samāwāti","e":"the heavens"},{"c":"وَالْأَرْضِ","d":"wal-arḍi","e":"and the earth"},{"c":"وَيَعْلَمُ","d":"wayaʿlamu","e":"and He knows"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"تُسِرُّونَ","d":"tusirrūna","e":"you conceal"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and what"},{"c":"تُعْلِنُونَ","d":"tuʿ'linūna","e":"you declare"},{"c":"وَاللَّهُ","d":"wal-lahu","e":"And Allah"},{"c":"عَلِيمٌ","d":"ʿalīmun","e":"(is) All-Knowing"},{"c":"بِذَاتِ","d":"bidhāti","e":"of what"},{"c":"الصُّدُورِ","d":"l-ṣudūri","e":"(is in) the breasts"}],"a":{"g":"He knows what is within the heavens and earth and knows what you conceal and what you declare. And Allah is Knowing of that within the breasts."}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"أَلَمْ","d":"alam","e":"Has not"},{"c":"يَأْتِكُمْ","d":"yatikum","e":"come to you"},{"c":"نَبَؤُا","d":"naba-u","e":"(the) news"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"(of) those who"},{"c":"كَفَرُوا","d":"kafarū","e":"disbelieved"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"قَبْلُ","d":"qablu","e":"before"},{"c":"فَذَاقُوا","d":"fadhāqū","e":"So they tasted"},{"c":"وَبَالَ","d":"wabāla","e":"(the) bad consequence"},{"c":"أَمْرِهِمْ","d":"amrihim","e":"(of) their affair"},{"c":"وَلَهُمْ","d":"walahum","e":"and for them"},{"c":"عَذَابٌ","d":"ʿadhābun","e":"(is) a punishment"},{"c":"أَلِيمٌ","d":"alīmun","e":"painful"}],"a":{"g":"Has there not come to you the news of those who disbelieved before? So they tasted the bad consequence of their affair, and they will have a painful punishment."}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"That"},{"c":"بِأَنَّهُ","d":"bi-annahu","e":"(is) because"},{"c":"كَانَتْ","d":"kānat","e":"had"},{"c":"تَأْتِيهِمْ","d":"tatīhim","e":"come to them"},{"c":"رُسُلُهُمْ","d":"rusuluhum","e":"their Messengers"},{"c":"بِالْبَيِّنَاتِ","d":"bil-bayināti","e":"with clear proofs"},{"c":"فَقَالُوا","d":"faqālū","e":"but they said"},{"c":"أَبَشَرٌ","d":"abasharun","e":"Shall human beings"},{"c":"يَهْدُونَنَا","d":"yahdūnanā","e":"guide us"},{"c":"فَكَفَرُوا","d":"fakafarū","e":"So they disbelieved"},{"c":"وَتَوَلَّوْا","d":"watawallaw","e":"and turned away"},{"c":"وَاسْتَغْنَى","d":"wa-is'taghnā","e":"And can do without them"},{"c":"اللَّهُ","d":"l-lahu","e":"Allah"},{"c":"وَاللَّهُ","d":"wal-lahu","e":"And Allah"},{"c":"غَنِيٌّ","d":"ghaniyyun","e":"(is) Self-sufficient"},{"c":"حَمِيدٌ","d":"ḥamīdun","e":"Praiseworthy"}],"a":{"g":"That is because their messengers used to come to them with clear evidences, but they said, \"Shall human beings guide us?\" and disbelieved and turned away. And Allah dispensed [with them]; and Allah is Free of need and Praiseworthy."}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"زَعَمَ","d":"zaʿama","e":"Claim"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"كَفَرُوا","d":"kafarū","e":"disbelieve"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"that"},{"c":"لَنْ","d":"lan","e":"never"},{"c":"يُبْعَثُوا","d":"yub'ʿathū","e":"will they be raised"},{"c":"قُلْ","d":"qul","e":"Say"},{"c":"بَلَى","d":"balā","e":"Yes"},{"c":"وَرَبِّي","d":"warabbī","e":"by my Lord"},{"c":"لَتُبْعَثُنَّ","d":"latub'ʿathunna","e":"surely you will be raised;"},{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"then"},{"c":"لَتُنَبَّؤُنَّ","d":"latunabba-unna","e":"surely you will be informed"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"of what"},{"c":"عَمِلْتُمْ","d":"ʿamil'tum","e":"you did"},{"c":"وَذَلِكَ","d":"wadhālika","e":"And that"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"for"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"يَسِيرٌ","d":"yasīrun","e":"(is) easy"}],"a":{"g":"Those who disbelieve have claimed that they will never be resurrected. Say, \"Yes, by my Lord, you will surely be resurrected; then you will surely be informed of what you did. And that, for Allah, is easy.\""}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"فَءَامِنُوا","d":"faāminū","e":"So believe"},{"c":"بِاللَّهِ","d":"bil-lahi","e":"in Allah"},{"c":"وَرَسُولِهِ","d":"warasūlihi","e":"and His Messenger"},{"c":"وَالنُّورِ","d":"wal-nūri","e":"and the Light"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"which"},{"c":"أَنْزَلْنَا","d":"anzalnā","e":"We have sent down"},{"c":"وَاللَّهُ","d":"wal-lahu","e":"And Allah"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"of what"},{"c":"تَعْمَلُونَ","d":"taʿmalūna","e":"you do"},{"c":"خَبِيرٌ","d":"khabīrun","e":"(is) All-Aware"}],"a":{"g":"So believe in Allah and His Messenger and the Qur'an which We have sent down. And Allah is Acquainted with what you do."}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"يَوْمَ","d":"yawma","e":"(The) Day"},{"c":"يَجْمَعُكُمْ","d":"yajmaʿukum","e":"He will assemble you"},{"c":"لِيَوْمِ","d":"liyawmi","e":"for (the) Day"},{"c":"الْجَمْعِ","d":"l-jamʿi","e":"(of) the Assembly"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"that"},{"c":"يَوْمُ","d":"yawmu","e":"(will be the) Day"},{"c":"التَّغَابُنِ","d":"l-taghābuni","e":"(of) mutual loss and gain"},{"c":"وَمَنْ","d":"waman","e":"And whoever"},{"c":"يُؤْمِنْ","d":"yu'min","e":"believes"},{"c":"بِاللَّهِ","d":"bil-lahi","e":"in Allah"},{"c":"وَيَعْمَلْ","d":"wayaʿmal","e":"and does"},{"c":"صَالِحًا","d":"ṣāliḥan","e":"righteousness"},{"c":"يُكَفِّرْ","d":"yukaffir","e":"He will remove"},{"c":"عَنْهُ","d":"ʿanhu","e":"from him"},{"c":"سَيِّئَاتِهِ","d":"sayyiātihi","e":"his misdeeds"},{"c":"وَيُدْخِلْهُ","d":"wayud'khil'hu","e":"and He will admit him"},{"c":"جَنَّاتٍ","d":"jannātin","e":"(to) Gardens"},{"c":"تَجْرِي","d":"tajrī","e":"flow"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"تَحْتِهَا","d":"taḥtihā","e":"underneath it"},{"c":"الْأَنْهَارُ","d":"l-anhāru","e":"the rivers"},{"c":"خَالِدِينَ","d":"khālidīna","e":"abiding"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"أَبَدًا","d":"abadan","e":"forever"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"That"},{"c":"الْفَوْزُ","d":"l-fawzu","e":"(is) the success"},{"c":"الْعَظِيمُ","d":"l-ʿaẓīmu","e":"the great"}],"a":{"g":"The Day He will assemble you for the Day of Assembly - that is the Day of Deprivation. And whoever believes in Allah and does righteousness - He will remove from him his misdeeds and admit him to gardens beneath which rivers flow, wherein they will abide forever. That is the great attainment."}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"وَالَّذِينَ","d":"wa-alladhīna","e":"But those who"},{"c":"كَفَرُوا","d":"kafarū","e":"disbelieved"},{"c":"وَكَذَّبُوا","d":"wakadhabū","e":"and denied"},{"c":"بِءَايَاتِنَا","d":"biāyātinā","e":"[in] Our Verses"},{"c":"أُولَئِكَ","d":"ulāika","e":"those"},{"c":"أَصْحَابُ","d":"aṣḥābu","e":"(are the) companions"},{"c":"النَّارِ","d":"l-nāri","e":"(of) the Fire"},{"c":"خَالِدِينَ","d":"khālidīna","e":"abiding forever"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"وَبِئْسَ","d":"wabi'sa","e":"And wretched is"},{"c":"الْمَصِيرُ","d":"l-maṣīru","e":"the destination"}],"a":{"g":"But the ones who disbelieved and denied Our verses - those are the companions of the Fire, abiding eternally therein; and wretched is the destination."}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"Not"},{"c":"أَصَابَ","d":"aṣāba","e":"strikes"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"مُصِيبَةٍ","d":"muṣībatin","e":"disaster"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"بِإِذْنِ","d":"bi-idh'ni","e":"by (the) permission"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"وَمَنْ","d":"waman","e":"And whoever"},{"c":"يُؤْمِنْ","d":"yu'min","e":"believes"},{"c":"بِاللَّهِ","d":"bil-lahi","e":"in Allah"},{"c":"يَهْدِ","d":"yahdi","e":"He guides"},{"c":"قَلْبَهُ","d":"qalbahu","e":"his heart"},{"c":"وَاللَّهُ","d":"wal-lahu","e":"And Allah"},{"c":"بِكُلِّ","d":"bikulli","e":"of every"},{"c":"شَيْءٍ","d":"shayin","e":"thing"},{"c":"عَلِيمٌ","d":"ʿalīmun","e":"(is) All-Knowing"}],"a":{"g":"No disaster strikes except by permission of Allah. And whoever believes in Allah - He will guide his heart. And Allah is Knowing of all things."}},"12":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَطِيعُوا","d":"wa-aṭīʿū","e":"So obey"},{"c":"اللَّهَ","d":"l-laha","e":"Allah"},{"c":"وَأَطِيعُوا","d":"wa-aṭīʿū","e":"and obey"},{"c":"الرَّسُولَ","d":"l-rasūla","e":"the Messenger;"},{"c":"فَإِنْ","d":"fa-in","e":"but if"},{"c":"تَوَلَّيْتُمْ","d":"tawallaytum","e":"you turn away"},{"c":"فَإِنَّمَا","d":"fa-innamā","e":"then only"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"upon"},{"c":"رَسُولِنَا","d":"rasūlinā","e":"Our Messenger"},{"c":"الْبَلَاغُ","d":"l-balāghu","e":"(is) the conveyance"},{"c":"الْمُبِينُ","d":"l-mubīnu","e":"clear"}],"a":{"g":"And obey Allah and obey the Messenger; but if you turn away - then upon Our Messenger is only [the duty of] clear notification."}},"13":{"w":[{"c":"اللَّهُ","d":"al-lahu","e":"Allah"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(there is) no"},{"c":"إِلَهَ","d":"ilāha","e":"god"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"Him"},{"c":"وَعَلَى","d":"waʿalā","e":"And upon"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"فَلْيَتَوَكَّلِ","d":"falyatawakkali","e":"let put (their) trust"},{"c":"الْمُؤْمِنُونَ","d":"l-mu'minūna","e":"the believers"}],"a":{"g":"Allah - there is no deity except Him. And upon Allah let the believers rely."}},"14":{"w":[{"c":"يَاأَيُّهَا","d":"yāayyuhā","e":"O"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"(you) who"},{"c":"ءَامَنُوا","d":"āmanū","e":"believe"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"أَزْوَاجِكُمْ","d":"azwājikum","e":"your spouses"},{"c":"وَأَوْلَادِكُمْ","d":"wa-awlādikum","e":"and your children"},{"c":"عَدُوًّا","d":"ʿaduwwan","e":"(are) enemies"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"to you"},{"c":"فَاحْذَرُوهُمْ","d":"fa-iḥ'dharūhum","e":"so beware of them"},{"c":"وَإِنْ","d":"wa-in","e":"But if"},{"c":"تَعْفُوا","d":"taʿfū","e":"you pardon"},{"c":"وَتَصْفَحُوا","d":"wataṣfaḥū","e":"and overlook"},{"c":"وَتَغْفِرُوا","d":"wataghfirū","e":"and forgive"},{"c":"فَإِنَّ","d":"fa-inna","e":"then indeed"},{"c":"اللَّهَ","d":"l-laha","e":"Allah"},{"c":"غَفُورٌ","d":"ghafūrun","e":"(is) Oft-Forgiving"},{"c":"رَحِيمٌ","d":"raḥīmun","e":"Most Merciful"}],"a":{"g":"O you who have believed, indeed, among your wives and your children are enemies to you, so beware of them. But if you pardon and overlook and forgive - then indeed, Allah is Forgiving and Merciful."}},"15":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّمَا","d":"innamā","e":"Only"},{"c":"أَمْوَالُكُمْ","d":"amwālukum","e":"your wealth"},{"c":"وَأَوْلَادُكُمْ","d":"wa-awlādukum","e":"and your children"},{"c":"فِتْنَةٌ","d":"fit'natun","e":"(are) a trial"},{"c":"وَاللَّهُ","d":"wal-lahu","e":"and Allah"},{"c":"عِنْدَهُ","d":"ʿindahu","e":"with Him"},{"c":"أَجْرٌ","d":"ajrun","e":"(is) a reward"},{"c":"عَظِيمٌ","d":"ʿaẓīmun","e":"great"}],"a":{"g":"Your wealth and your children are but a trial, and Allah has with Him a great reward."}},"16":{"w":[{"c":"فَاتَّقُوا","d":"fa-ittaqū","e":"So fear"},{"c":"اللَّهَ","d":"l-laha","e":"Allah"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"as much as"},{"c":"اسْتَطَعْتُمْ","d":"is'taṭaʿtum","e":"you are able"},{"c":"وَاسْمَعُوا","d":"wa-is'maʿū","e":"and listen"},{"c":"وَأَطِيعُوا","d":"wa-aṭīʿū","e":"and obey"},{"c":"وَأَنْفِقُوا","d":"wa-anfiqū","e":"and spend;"},{"c":"خَيْرًا","d":"khayran","e":"(it is) better"},{"c":"لِأَنْفُسِكُمْ","d":"li-anfusikum","e":"for your souls"},{"c":"وَمَنْ","d":"waman","e":"And whoever"},{"c":"يُوقَ","d":"yūqa","e":"is saved"},{"c":"شُحَّ","d":"shuḥḥa","e":"(from the) greediness"},{"c":"نَفْسِهِ","d":"nafsihi","e":"(of) his soul"},{"c":"فَأُولَئِكَ","d":"fa-ulāika","e":"then those"},{"c":"هُمُ","d":"humu","e":"[they]"},{"c":"الْمُفْلِحُونَ","d":"l-muf'liḥūna","e":"(are) the successful ones"}],"a":{"g":"So fear Allah as much as you are able and listen and obey and spend [in the way of Allah]; it is better for your selves. And whoever is protected from the stinginess of his soul - it is those who will be the successful."}},"17":{"w":[{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"If"},{"c":"تُقْرِضُوا","d":"tuq'riḍū","e":"you loan"},{"c":"اللَّهَ","d":"l-laha","e":"(to) Allah"},{"c":"قَرْضًا","d":"qarḍan","e":"a loan"},{"c":"حَسَنًا","d":"ḥasanan","e":"goodly"},{"c":"يُضَاعِفْهُ","d":"yuḍāʿif'hu","e":"He will multiply it"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"for you"},{"c":"وَيَغْفِرْ","d":"wayaghfir","e":"and will forgive"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"you"},{"c":"وَاللَّهُ","d":"wal-lahu","e":"And Allah"},{"c":"شَكُورٌ","d":"shakūrun","e":"(is) Most Appreciative"},{"c":"حَلِيمٌ","d":"ḥalīmun","e":"Most Forbearing"}],"a":{"g":"If you loan Allah a goodly loan, He will multiply it for you and forgive you. And Allah is Most Appreciative and Forbearing."}},"18":{"w":[{"c":"عَالِمُ","d":"ʿālimu","e":"(The) Knower"},{"c":"الْغَيْبِ","d":"l-ghaybi","e":"(of) the unseen"},{"c":"وَالشَّهَادَةِ","d":"wal-shahādati","e":"and the witnessed"},{"c":"الْعَزِيزُ","d":"l-ʿazīzu","e":"the All-Mighty"},{"c":"الْحَكِيمُ","d":"l-ḥakīmu","e":"the All-Wise"}],"a":{"g":"Knower of the unseen and the witnessed, the Exalted in Might, the Wise."}}}